        "Content": "** RAY COOKE LETTINGS PLEASE FOLLOW US ON FACEBOOK AND INSTAGRAM AS PROPERTIES ARE ADVERTISED THERE FIRST- VIDEO VIEWINGS AVAILABLE ON REQUEST **\n*** FOUR BEDROOM / THREE BATHROOM HOUSE *** NEW BUILD *** FULLY FURNISHED *** FIRST TIME LETTING *** A RATED *** AVAILABLE NOW ***\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS are delighted to present this exceptional four-bedroom, three-bathroom home to the rental market, ideally situated in Kingsbry, Maynooth, Co. Kildare.\nThis newly built semi-detached property offers the perfect blend of modern, comfortable living in a highly sought-after location.\nExternally, the property welcomes you with an attractive partial brick façade, a paved front area and a large private concrete rear garden, providing excellent outdoor space with minimal maintenance required.\nInternally, the property boasts an excellent balance of living and bedroom accommodation, complemented by all the benefits of a newly built home. The property comes beautifully presented throughout with new furniture, appliances and contemporary finishes.\nTo the rear of the property lies the impressive open-plan kitchen and dining area, which forms the heart of the home. Bright and spacious, the kitchen is fitted with attractive wooden cabinetry, generous countertop and storage space, modern appliances and practical tiled flooring.\nUpstairs, the accommodation comprises three bright and comfortable bedrooms together with two bathrooms. The bedrooms benefit from excellent natural light through large windows and are finished in clean, neutral tones. The main bathroom is fully tiled from floor to ceiling and features a full-size bath, while the property also benefits from an additional en-suite bathroom.\nA particularly unique feature of this property is the fourth bedroom located at ground-floor level. This space can function as a private, self-contained one-bedroom/one-bathroom internal apartment, complete with its own modern kitchen facilities. This versatile accommodation would be ideal for those seeking additional privacy or separate living space within the home.\nIdeally positioned within the mature and highly popular Kingsbry development, the property is within easy walking distance of Maynooth Town Centre and Maynooth University. Residents can enjoy an excellent selection of shops, cafés, restaurants and local amenities close by.\nThe location is also exceptionally convenient for commuters, with easy access to the M4 motorway, local bus services and Maynooth Train Station, providing excellent connectivity to Dublin and surrounding areas.\nThis is a superb opportunity to rent a newly built, beautifully presented home offering generous and versatile accommodation in one of Maynooth's most convenient residential locations. AVAILABLE NOW, and viewing is highly advised!\n\nSpecial Features -\nNewly built 4-bedroom semi-detached home\n4 bedrooms and 3 bathrooms\nUnique self-contained 1-bed / 1-bath internal apartment at ground-floor level\nSeparate modern kitchen facilities within the ground-floor accommodation\nBright and spacious open-plan kitchen and dining area\nBrand-new furniture and appliances throughout\nContemporary, neutral interior finishes\nFully tiled main bathroom with full-size bath\nEn-suite bathroom\nGenerously sized double bedrooms with excellent natural light\nLarge private concrete rear garden\nAttractive partial brick façade\nLow-maintenance paved front area\nSituated within the popular Kingsbry development\nWalking distance to Maynooth Town Centre and Maynooth University\nExcellent access to the M4 motorway\nConvenient to Maynooth Train Station and local bus routes\nExcellent selection of shops, restaurants and amenities nearby\nAVAILABLE NOW!!\n***RAY COOKE LETTINGS EMAIL ENQUIRY ONLY/NO PHONE CALLS PLEASE FILL IN YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION AND WE WILL CONTACT YOU WITH VIEWING DETAILS WHEN THEY ARISE**"
      },
